## Quality gate

- [ ] Source manifest identifies the exact source version and rights basis.
- [ ] Every major claim has a source locator or is explicitly marked as inference.
- [ ] The argument map captures relationships, not just chapter headings.
- [ ] Criticism states impact on application and includes a strong opposing view.
- [ ] Candidate capabilities map to atomic user problems and cite evidence.
- [ ] Coverage gaps and uncertainty are explicit.
- [ ] Any material uncertainty requiring a user choice is resolved or explicitly blocks progression.

